-- check/bad: a list column is split by length (checker.md §6.6, amended
-- 2026-10-01), so a `case` that names only the empty list is missing every
-- non-empty one — and the example is spelled in the list syntax,
-- `[ _, ..._ ]`, not as the length alternative the algorithm uses
-- internally.
pub headOr : List Int → Int
headOr xs =
    case xs of
        [] →
            0
